  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Strategy  / Trade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Africa Strategy and Innovation Fund supports the broad objectives of the Government&#x2019;s Africa Strategy and the Global Ireland policy, which commits to doubling Ireland&#x2019;s global footprint. It also supports innovative approaches to the implementation of Ireland&#x2019;s new policy for international development, &#x2018;A Better World&#x2019;. These policies provide an increased impetus to expand our bilateral relationships, deepen our political engagement, innovate with our development cooperation and continue to seek opportunities for trade and investments in Africa. Increasing trade with countries in Africa, and supporting their inclusive and sustainable economic growth, is a focus of the Africa Strategy and Innovation Fund.</narrative>
  </description>
